/**
 * Livsfaser & personlig utveckling → Identitet & värderingar, 1241–1247 (0.29): self-image and identity,
 * belonging, norms and expectations, worldviews, integrity and privacy, personal convictions and changing
 * one's self-image. Almost every word is abstract, so the pictures are small symbolic scenes: mirrors and
 * masks for the self, circles and puzzles for belonging, crowds of grey figures for norms. Religion is shown
 * only with buildings, light and neutral gestures – never with caricatures. Posed figures (`F`) reach with
 * real arms from the shoulder.
 */
